min":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/db1b6b93562ff93adb2808b2c93ab3c63074b301\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (f92f1ce9c) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated Intel(R) Arc(TM) A770 Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.6913) - AMD Ryzen 5 7600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 55.60 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nPR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108028 introduced the following pragma to the fog shader.\n```glsl\n#pragma use_vulkan_memory_model\n```\nThis causes the SPIR-V -> NIR -> DXIL converter to fail with the following errors.\n```\nSPIR-V WARNING:\n    In file godot-mesa\\src\\compiler\\spirv\\spirv_to_nir.c:4553\n    Unsupported SPIR-V capability: SpvCapabilityVulkanMemoryModel (5345)\n    28 bytes into the SPIR-V binary\nSPIR-V parsing FAILED:\n    In file godot-mesa\\src\\compiler\\spirv\\spirv_to_nir.c:4735\n    Vulkan memory model is unsupported by this driver\n    60 bytes into the SPIR-V binary\n```\nAs it stands, this causes D3D12 to fail on Forward+\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSimply open any project on Forward+\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[d-3d-12.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21302973/d-3d-12.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repit